    "text": "By Augostina Mallous ,\n8 hours ago LIBERTY COUNTY, Ga. (WTOC) - Neighbors on Poncell Dr. say asphalt recently placed on their road is kicking up dust they breathe, and washing into a pond and marsh just steps from their homes. The road, which borders wetlands on one side and a pond on the other, was resurfaced... Read full article",
